node_modules/

# Note: data/config.json IS committed on purpose. It holds the deployed
# defaults (prefix, cooldowns, permissions). There are no secrets in it:
# Twitch credentials never reach the server, chat runs in the browser.
# Edits made via the control UI land on disk at runtime but are lost when an
# ephemeral host redeploys or spins down.

# Note: data/villagers.json IS committed on purpose. It is the villager roster
# the app deploys with, so builds do not have to reach Nookipedia (which blocks
# some datacenter IP ranges with HTTP 403). It is CC BY-SA text data, contains
# no Nintendo assets, and only stores image URLs rather than images themselves.
# Rebuild it locally with "npm run refresh" and commit the result when you want
# current data.

# Vendored audio sprite, re-fetch with "npm run setup".
# Game audio, so definitely do not commit it.
public/sounds/

*.log
.DS_Store
